          <content>Use case : &#xD;
Compliance officers can access the whole universe to build reports while not necessarily the right to detokenize.&#xD;
Need service account for odata to see the whole universe&#xD;
plus additional RegData Access Right Control BEFORE detokenization&#xD;
</content>
